The statute specifies that records of the society are retained according to the schedule outlined within the statute itself. Specifically, the retention period for ledgers is eleven calendar years, after which they are shredded. [[cite:obs-e3d45946fdfec3d0ca07ccdf631938fb97b0faeb "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]][[cite:obs-46611a66e9d66e6f0d7ae51cc3b16b73126ea454 "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]]